<!-- [EN] One canvas per animation, labeled for accessibility when `label` is set. In WeChat DevTools a still image of the frame covers it while the animation is not playing (see CYL_USES_SNAPSHOTS in index.js). [CN] 每个动画一个画布；设置 `label` 时带无障碍标签。在微信开发者工具中，动画未播放时由当前帧的静态图片覆盖（见 index.js 中的 CYL_USES_SNAPSHOTS）。 -->
<view class="cyl-lottie-box">
  <canvas
    type="2d"
    id="{{cylCanvasId}}"
    class="cyl-lottie-canvas {{cylSnapshotShown ? 'cyl-lottie-canvas-covered' : ''}}"
    aria-role="img"
    aria-label="{{label}}"
    aria-hidden="{{!label}}"
  ></canvas>
  <image
    wx:if="{{cylSnapshotShown}}"
    class="cyl-lottie-snapshot"
    src="{{cylSnapshot}}"
    mode="scaleToFill"
    aria-hidden="true"
  />
</view>
